===Etymology===
{{OE.}} ''[[boni]]'', probably from {{F.}} ''[[bon]]'', feminine ''[[bonne]]'' (meaning [[good]]), from {{L.}} ''[[bonus]]'' (meaning good). See ''[[bounty]]'', and compare ''[[bonus]]'', ''[[boon]]''. 

